               MOVE 'N' TO PR-SW
               MOVE ZERO TO SUM-FED-WH.
           READ PAYROLL-REGISTER-DATA
               AT END
                   MOVE 'Y' TO END-OF-FILE-SWITCH.

       199-EXIT.
           EXIT.

